# Below 40x10 only the focused pane and the status line are drawn; growing again brings both panes back.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
END
keys G <C-w> v
see │  󰋜 › Work › Report
resize 39 9
see   󰋜 › Work › Report
hide │
hide Errands:
resize 100 30
see │  󰋜 › Work › Report
see   Errands:
